        "The file is shorter than it was, or the same length with a reason"
      ],
      "file": "04-claude-md-matches-project.html",
      "summary": "Read your CLAUDE.md as an auditor: run every command it names, check every path, test one rule on a scratch branch, and cut what is no longer true.",
